{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_12_call_and_construct_signatures_call_signature", "label": "Call signature", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/typescript/pages/phase-1-type-vocabulary/12-call-and-construct-signatures.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The arrow form cannot carry properties. An interface with a call signature types middleware, memoised functions with .cache, and decorated handlers."}, {"id": "docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_12_call_and_construct_signatures_construct_signature", "label": "Construct signature", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/typescript/pages/phase-1-type-vocabulary/12-call-and-construct-signatures.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "new (...) => T describes a constructor, not an instance. abstract new accepts abstract classes that a plain new rejects."}, {"id": "docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_12_call_and_construct_signatures_typeof_class", "label": "typeof Class static side", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/typescript/pages/phase-1-type-vocabulary/12-call-and-construct-signatures.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Widget is the instance type. typeof Widget is the constructor plus static members. Property 'create' does not exist on type 'Repo' means the static lives on typeof Repo."}, {"id": "docs_typescript_pages_phase_1_type_vocabulary_12_call_and_construct_signatures_hybrid_type", "label": "Hybrid type", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/typescript/pages/phase-1-type-vocabulary/12-call-and-construct-signatures.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Call or construct signature plus ordinar